              "answer": "360",
              "explanation": "四边形可以分成两个三角形，每个三角形的内角和是180°，所以四边形的内角和 = 180° \\times 2 = 360°。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "unit-math-4-up-rjb-p5::kp-geo-007"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "提高"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unit-math-4-up-rjb-p5::u7-ex-017",
              "type": "single",
              "question": "一个等腰三角形的顶角是80°，它的一个底角是（　　）。",
              "options": [
                "A. 50°",
                "B. 80°",
                "C. 100°",
                "D. 40°"
              ],
              "answer": "A",
              "explanation": "等腰三角形两个底角相等。底角 = (180° - 80°) ÷ 2 = 100° ÷ 2 = 50°。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
